      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To begin the process, trigger the resupply cycle and then check the inventory level."
      ],
      "justification": "The opening clause implicitly starts the process, describes triggering/resupplying, and checking inventory."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the inventory level is at or below the minimum"
